# def2-TZVPP on P, F, S and Cl only: relieves the classic bottleneck for phosphorus frequencies (insufficient tight d functions).
# Starting geometry: converged structure from EXP_GD_soman.out
! B3LYP 6-311++G(d,p) TightOpt NumFreq
%pal nprocs 8 end
%maxcore 1400
%elprop Polar 1 end
%basis
  NewGTO P  "def2-TZVPP" end
  NewGTO F  "def2-TZVPP" end
  NewGTO S  "def2-TZVPP" end
  NewGTO Cl "def2-TZVPP" end
end
